rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ada8eefd352f4f911bf2a78715b6a7c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b0c324be/uploads/origins/1e867111-f09e-4fbf-a7d8-8437b9450c24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7d7599f04d45b76f28d8a19910030fe4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、skebさんのホームページで最近の投稿を拝見しました！私のキャラクターを描いてくれませんか？\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/folders/1O6zJzPq6AALAsaZv3VAyspSJ33vBD7Hk?sort=13&direction=a\n\n構図はお任せします！  性描写はありません。ありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@slumpa1008/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ec05842/uploads/origins/17f1de42-8e25-45cc-842e-3c38669d4448?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=097d0d98fbe460542a5c0d08fde6c73a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ec05842/uploads/origins/17f1de42-8e25-45cc-842e-3c38669d4448?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=097d0d98fbe460542a5c0d08fde6c73a, https://si.imgix.net/3ec05842/uploads/origins/17f1de42-8e25-45cc-842e-3c38669d4448?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d191ee2d23962245dea2955d7c855142 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ec05842/uploads/origins/17f1de42-8e25-45cc-842e-3c38669d4448?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e20d08f21d43af90e5073e3c1f24c28e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "アズレン磯風ちゃんのえっちなイラストをお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@slumpa1008/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d59a7eb4/uploads/origins/e3bc80ab-525f-4de1-8678-74f52567785a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ba16792fb9f3948a6b2573c185eaf2b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d59a7eb4/uploads/origins/e3bc80ab-525f-4de1-8678-74f52567785a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ba16792fb9f3948a6b2573c185eaf2b, https://si.imgix.net/d59a7eb4/uploads/origins/